ttps://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223670516296\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223670516296\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/LnO09/bl4O5B0KSQj/kB9Ke7JkfPox5GVNQYOLXk/kakaolink40_original.png?width=270&amp;height=270\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223670516296\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223670516296\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/LnO09/bl4O5B0KSQj/kB9Ke7JkfPox5GVNQYOLXk/kakaolink40_original.png?width=270&amp;height=270\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">2025년은 #양자역학의 해(year) , #불확정성원리 100주년</p><p class=\"og-desc\">1925년 하이젠베르크의 불확정성원리가 발표된 해이다. 2005년 기적의 해 100주년이었다면, 2025년은 양자...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><br>&#39;세계 양자역학 기술의 해&#39; 맞이 행사</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그래서 교장선생님께 교무부장선생님께 그냥 말했습니다</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#39;이런 행사 할 계획입니다.&#39;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">언제 할꺼냐는 물음이 와서</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그날 검색을 막 합니다.</span><br><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223757856848?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223757856848?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"#중학교에서 '#양자역학의해' #행사주간 만들기\" data-og-description=\"중학교에서 '양자역학의 해' 행사주간 운영 올해는 세계 양자과학, 양자기술의 해이다. 그래서 ...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223757856848?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223757856848\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dujXmy/hyZjewV82s/ETvXgqQCqB1TzIffSCJKgK/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=1031&amp;face=257_225_482_471\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223757856848?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223757856848?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dujXmy/hyZjewV82s/ETvXgqQCqB1TzIffSCJKgK/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=1031&amp;face=257_225_482_471\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">#중학교에서 '#양자역학의해' #행사주간 만들기</p><p class=\"og-desc\">중학교에서 '양자역학의 해' 행사주간 운영 올해는 세계 양자과학, 양자기술의 해이다. 그래서 ...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">ChatGPT가 대답을 잘해줍니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">여러개를 추천해주고 그 중 고릅니다</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">→ 7월 7일~11일 주간</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">1925년 7월 9일, 베르너 하이젠베르크가 양자역학의 기초를 놓은 행렬역학 논문을 발표</span>했습니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;여름방학 전에 과학 주간을 운영하기 좋은 시기이며, 현대 물리학의 시작점을 기리는 의미가 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그래서 학사 일정에 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">7월9일~11일 일정을 넣었습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3. </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;그래서 6월말 기안합니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d52d2bbf191d2f42c53781ae8f3d8b4f0387680\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d52d2bbf191d2f42c53781ae8f3d8b4f0387680\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"398\"><div class=\"figcaption\">6워</div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">7월8일(오늘)에 기말고사 일정이 끝납니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">저희학교 과학선생님들과 함께 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">오늘 세팅을 하였습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d66ed8d3601baf2a9e86646e898027424f308af\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d66ed8d3601baf2a9e86646e898027424f308af\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c111f126477ff617c0ef55b97a7f2b66cf872d17\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c111f126477ff617c0ef55b97a7f2b66cf872d17\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/247fc959e658b949fd647e39184573182c7dbd8a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/247fc959e658b949fd647e39184573182c7dbd8a\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06ad4cebc14db295def3d6a68d9963f9e642a23c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06ad4cebc14db295def3d6a68d9963f9e642a23c\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"512\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf4930e8be2657e2287776b4d981ff843b605972\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf4930e8be2657e2287776b4d981ff843b605972\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd26d5d34e44bb30a3990b14d3ca5b547cc77484\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd26d5d34e44bb30a3990b14d3ca5b547cc77484\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제일 중요한 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">원자의 크기는? 파트의 사진을 못찍었다는 ㅠ&#160;</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사실 대단한 내용의 체험기구가 있는 것은 아닙니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(각 파트별 숨어 있는 양자역학 내용 스토리가 있습니다ㅎㅎㅎ)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">양자라는 이름을 넣은 프로그램을 만들고 싶었고</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아이들에게 양자역학의 이야기 장이 되는 공간과 시간을 만들고 싶었습니다.]</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">5.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기말고사 끝나고 교실에서 뭐 할지 고민되는 것을</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 이동하여 체험하게 합니다</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a2de9023184eeab431b1f3fff0a011221e40bb12\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a2de9023184eeab431b1f3fff0a011221e40bb12\" data-origin-width=\"966\" data-origin-height=\"652\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">모든 학급이 다 돌아가지 않아서 조금 아쉬운<br>&#160;<br><br>6. <br>내일 행사가 진행됩니다 ^^<br>이 행사는 <br>양자역학을 좋아하는.. <br>개인적으로 하고 싶었던...<br>그런 행사..... 입니다<br><br>&#160;<br></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvb507xlvkblbw5b58ecyn9ee@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvb507xlvkblbw5b58ecyn9ee/thumbs/6.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33308893653&amp;signature=tGkt26XEbkPsVKx5a5R%2FQBOMfUU%3D&amp;ts=1751984853\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvb507xlvkblbw5b58ecyn9ee?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2YjUwN3hsdmtibGJ3NWI1OGVjeW45ZWUiLCJ0aWQiOiI1MWVjZWQyYi03Mzk0LTQ4ZTAtOTZiYy01MGVjMjVmZjc5MjMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxOTE4NTV9.JmDeqIaCObqgYGmI6MgXTMa3xs2dTThL9zGjYXKFN-1P6ldSvy1fkkZiTohfHdeefII63TVFl4SUpMUerOU9FQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
